{"2159560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glowmonkey2k", "steam_appid": 2159560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After all these years, the creator of Choose Your Weapon is finally bringing Glowmonkey to Steam. Glowmonkey2k reveals the origin story behind the deadly stickman virus from </strong> <strong>the classic Flash series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and battle through corrupted servers while switching weapons on the fly to defeat enemies immune to the wrong attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Digital War Against Y2K</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1999. A mysterious digital threat is about to bring the world crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of the classic Choose Your Weapon series comes the official origin story of Glowmonkey and the events that set the digital war against Y2K in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop it, scientists created a powerful secret agent and injected him into the Dark Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of Glowmonkey</strong> as he navigates corrupted systems, hunts down the deadly stickman virus, and uncovers the truth behind a world on the brink.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Through Corrupted Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowmonkey2k is a fast-paced retro 2D action platformer where every encounter can take you out if you're not prepared. Run, jump, and battle through six unique servers overrun by a deadly stickman virus. Each realm is ruled by a powerful Y2K boss variant, pushing you to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an arsenal of bizarre weapons, Glowmonkey must battle through corrupted servers and stop the deadly stickman virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies resist certain attacks—use the wrong weapon, and you won't survive. This forces you to strategically slash, smash, shoot, and chop your way through each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Hidden Truths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each realm to collect hidden items, discover strange clues, and piece together the mystery behind Glowmonkey’s creation and the true origin of the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something inside the system doesn’t add up… and the truth behind the virus may be closer to you than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f5e058e3c1ffcfd2acc22b18c09ba2eb.webp?t=1786660607\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f5e058e3c1ffcfd2acc22b18c09ba2eb.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=64 /></picture></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/ce028dca7bd07958b0c00804a916ca43.avif?t=1786660607\" width=192 height=64 /></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=192 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic weapon switching to defeat immune enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique digital realms, each with its own enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced retro 2D platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles against Y2K variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items, secrets, and story clues to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious origin story waiting to be uncovered</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After all these years, the creator of Choose Your Weapon is finally bringing Glowmonkey to Steam. Glowmonkey2k reveals the origin story behind the deadly stickman virus from </strong> <strong>the classic Flash series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and battle through corrupted servers while switching weapons on the fly to defeat enemies immune to the wrong attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the Digital War Against Y2K</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1999. A mysterious digital threat is about to bring the world crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of the classic Choose Your Weapon series comes the official origin story of Glowmonkey and the events that set the digital war against Y2K in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop it, scientists created a powerful secret agent and injected him into the Dark Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/544f08b81f23f9d83747e6ec8dcf4ee6.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of Glowmonkey</strong> as he navigates corrupted systems, hunts down the deadly stickman virus, and uncovers the truth behind a world on the brink.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Through Corrupted Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f3595666cf8d1f961f3446e018fad7bf.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowmonkey2k is a fast-paced retro 2D action platformer where every encounter can take you out if you're not prepared. Run, jump, and battle through six unique servers overrun by a deadly stickman virus. Each realm is ruled by a powerful Y2K boss variant, pushing you to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/064ddb03fb64d6fd0a9ef8d9d29fc848.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an arsenal of bizarre weapons, Glowmonkey must battle through corrupted servers and stop the deadly stickman virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies resist certain attacks—use the wrong weapon, and you won't survive. This forces you to strategically slash, smash, shoot, and chop your way through each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/45f6b5ce44f1cb7c965bad371e1fb088.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Hidden Truths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each realm to collect hidden items, discover strange clues, and piece together the mystery behind Glowmonkey’s creation and the true origin of the virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something inside the system doesn’t add up… and the truth behind the virus may be closer to you than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f5e058e3c1ffcfd2acc22b18c09ba2eb.webp?t=1786660607\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/f5e058e3c1ffcfd2acc22b18c09ba2eb.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=64 /></picture></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/ce028dca7bd07958b0c00804a916ca43.avif?t=1786660607\" width=192 height=64 /></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.poster.avif?t=1786660607\" width=192 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.webm?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2159560/extras/8fe2c79a64d674afbeeef85f0fd71a14.mp4?t=1786660607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic weapon switching to defeat immune enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique digital realms, each with its own enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced retro 2D platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles against Y2K variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items, secrets, and story clues to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious origin story waiting to be uncovered</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fight through a corrupted digital world as Glowmonkey, switching weapons on the fly to defeat enemies immune to the wrong attack.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic